<Legal title="Refund & Cancellation Policy">
  <p><em>Review and customise before going live. This is a starting point, not legal advice.</em></p>

  <h2>Nature of the product</h2>
  <p>Combos are <strong>digital goods</strong> delivered instantly. Because the files are downloadable immediately after payment, they are generally non-refundable once the download link has been issued.</p>

  <h2>When we will help</h2>
  <p>We want you to be happy with your purchase. We will review a refund or resolution on a case-by-case basis if:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>You were <strong>charged more than once</strong> for the same order, or charged in error;</li>
    <li>The <strong>download link never worked</strong> and we were unable to deliver the files; or</li>
    <li>The files are <strong>materially different</strong> from what was described on the project page.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>In these cases, contact us within <strong>7 days</strong> of purchase with your order id and a description of the issue.</p>

  <h2>What isn't covered</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Change of mind after the files have been downloaded.</li>
    <li>Lack of the required components, tools, or skills to complete a build.</li>
    <li>Issues with third-party components bought via affiliate links (raise those with the store).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How refunds are issued</h2>
  <p>Approved refunds are returned to the original payment method via Razorpay, typically within 5–7 business days. We may offer a replacement or store credit as an alternative where appropriate.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>To request a refund or report a problem, use the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> with your order id.</p>
</Legal>
